sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Flutter Courier
    participant Y as YARP
    participant D as Delivery API and local relay
    participant DB as Delivery DB
    participant O as Private object storage
    participant B as RabbitMQ
    participant W as Notification Worker
    participant NDB as Notifications DB
    participant M as Merchant API and dispatcher
    participant MDB as Merchant DB
    participant E as Merchant HTTPS receiver
    participant V as Authorized React/Flutter viewer
    C->>Y: UpdateDeliveryStatus or CompleteDeliveryWithProof
    Y->>D: JWT, expectedVersion, Idempotency-Key
    D->>D: Check role, current assignment and valid transition
    alt Unauthorized, stale or invalid state
        D-->>C: 401 / 403 / 404 / 409, no effects
    else Authorized
        opt CompleteDeliveryWithProof only
            D->>O: Validate and stage photo/signature
            O-->>D: Persistence confirmed or storage failure
            Note over D,O: Failure returns 503 unchanged, DB conflict later leaves cleanup orphan
        end
        opt Required proof conditions met (or non-proof status)
            D->>DB: Atomic versioned status + history + StatusChanged outbox + response
            DB-->>D: Commit
            D-->>C: 200 committed status/version
            D->>B: Relay publishes StatusChanged after commit
            par Durable notifications
                B->>W: notification-status queue
                W->>D: NotificationContext(eventId, parcelId, version) service JWT
                D-->>W: Minimum authorized recipient IDs
                W->>NDB: Atomic inbox + unique notification/provider/dispatch jobs
                W-->>B: ACK only after durable commit
                W->>W: In-app record and mock provider send
                opt merchantId exists
                    W->>M: DispatchWebhook event, scoped service JWT
                    M->>MDB: Deduplicate and persist subscription jobs
                    M-->>W: 202 durable acceptance
                    M->>M: SSRF checks, decrypt secret, fresh timestamp/HMAC
                    M->>E: Signed HTTPS POST
                    E-->>M: 2xx or retryable failure
                    M->>MDB: Record attempt, six-attempt retry policy
                end
            and Authorized current status
                B->>D: delivery-realtime queue
                D->>DB: Read latest committed version
                D-->>V: Authenticated SSE snapshot
            end
            Note over B,M: Stable eventId and unique effect keys suppress duplicate jobs
        end
    end
